      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "从「接口超时」到「16 秒变 10 毫秒」的完整链路："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "mermaid",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "flowchart LR\n  A[接口超时 / context canceled] --> B[夜莺 + Loki 捞慢日志]\n  B --> C[日志出现 duration 4~16 秒]\n  C --> D[EXPLAIN 看执行计划]\n  D --> E{Seq Scan 全表扫描}\n  E -->|确认缺索引| F[补建索引 + ANALYZE]\n  F --> G[16 秒降到 10 毫秒]"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 2,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
