            "type": "text",
            "value": "context canceled 导致事务状态混乱"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "context-canceled-导致事务状态混乱"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "text",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "err: context canceled; sql: transaction has already been committed or rolled back"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "上游设了超时（5s），SQL 还没跑完就被 cancel，但数据库端可能已经执行完了。Go 的 "
          },
          {
            "type": "inlineCode",
            "value": "database/sql"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " 检测到事务状态变了就报这个错。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "影响：应用层认为失败可能重试，但实际已经成功——好在 "
          },
          {
            "type": "inlineCode",
            "value": "SET revoked=true"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " 是幂等操作，没有造成脏数据。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "OR 条件让索引更难被使用"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "or-条件让索引更难被使用"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "inlineCode",
            "value": "WHERE uniscid = ? OR entname = ?"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " 即使两个字段都有单列索引，优化器也可能选择全表扫描。部分索引 + 更新统计信息后改善；代码层面拆成 "
          },
          {
            "type": "inlineCode",
            "value": "UNION"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " 更稳妥。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "GORM 日志全是文本格式"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "gorm-日志全是文本格式"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "字段靠正则提取，效率低。建议改成 JSON 输出，方便日志系统结构化查询。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 2,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "夜莺 + Loki 慢日志查询备忘"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "夜莺-loki-慢日志查询备忘"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "这次排查全程靠夜莺看日志，常用的 LogQL 语句整理如下，以后直接抄。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
